<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY FOUR WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY FOUR WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka beat Australia by four wickets in the third match of the Singer World Series one-day (50 overs) cricket tournament on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 228-9 in 50 overs, Sri Lanka 232-6 in 45.5 overs.</p>
